  "After receiving a notification, the app may crash during shipment scanning. [Nesy Mobile - app crashing]": "",
  "StopListFragment scan + FCM notification — app crash during scan after notification. God Object + race.": "",
  "ES3/ES4 — God Object single shared state + FCM×UI race. Notification state and scan state collide in the same SharedViewModel → crash.": "",
  "Null/crash guard was added; since the God Object was not decomposed, the crash recurred at different timings.": "",
  "Critical. OPEN. Without God Object decomposition (Phase 2 MVI) + WorkManager serialization, the crash will recur.": "",
  "Per-screen ViewModel (ADR-02) + WorkManager serialized FCM + UiEffect Channel.": "",
  "Duplicate TOUR event is being triggered for the same shipment.": "",
  "State & Race": "",
  "Shipment was reassigned while already on tour, 2 tour events were sent and delivery was done twice. Shipments whose last trigger event is TOUR should not be reassigned. Shipment is created. [Nesy Mobile - double TOUR?]": "",
  "SharedViewModel (3,450 LOC) + Room JSON chunk + FCM handler. Shipment on tour is reassigned, producing 2 TOUR + 2 DELY.": "",
  "ES1/ES3 — FCM × UI race condition. When a shipment is already on TOUR, concurrent writes with 'last-writer-wins' produce duplicate events; the last trigger event check is not atomic.": "",
  "Reassignment check was added; the race recurred because thread safety (Mutex/transaction) was not in place.": "",
  "Critical. Without WorkManager serialization + Room transaction, the duplicate TOUR/DELY race will recur — this is a structural issue that cannot be solved by careful coding alone.": "",
  "WorkManager serialized FCM + Room transaction + idempotent event (NESY-ARCH-001/005).": "",
  "Delivery error is occurring when taking TOUR after LCR, DEPT, EXPI, and COPT.": "",
