  "Delivery Failed — dely/delyFailed error when taken to TOUR after LCR+DEPT+EXPI+COPT. EventProcessor ordering.": "",
  "ED3 (K2) — LCR+DDSP event ordering race. When events arrive in parallel, the order is disrupted (DDSP→LCR), causing incorrect reservation/delivery status.": "",
